OL,3,GNEWSA'End injustice and make funding
OL,4,Afairer for our kids'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnd a long-standing injustice by making
OL,7,Ffunding fairer for children in a county
OL,8,Fwhere each pupil gets #5,000 less per
OL,9,Fyear than the best supported areas, a
OL,10,Fpetition states.
OL,12,FIn what is believed to be the first
OL,13,Fcase of its kind in the UK,
OL,14,FGloucestershire County Council has
OL,15,Flaunched a petition asking central
OL,16,Fgovernment to "make funding fairer" for
OL,17,Fits roads and schools.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
