OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSA'End injustice and make funding
OL,4,Afairer for our kids'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne teacher said they have to choose
OL,7,Fbetween repairing leaky roofs or paying
OL,8,Ffor new books, while about #90m is
OL,9,Fneeded to make essential repairs to the
OL,10,Fcounty's roads.
OL,12,FA spokesperson for the Ministry of
OL,13,FHousing, Communities and Local
OL,14,FGovernment said: "We're fixing an
OL,15,Foutdated funding system, so money goes
OL,16,Fwhere need is greatest."
